----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var d = 5

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

let q = 100 /! d

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

set b = 500
let e = q + 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 5
----------

let c = b + 1

----------
expect all five units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `d` = 5 |
| 2 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 500 |
| 3 | reads `d` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `q` = 20 |
| 4 | overwrites `b` (2), reads `q` (3) | compiles, runs | new | `e` = 21 |
| 5 | reads `b` (2) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 501 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

var d = 0

----------
expect unit 1 is edited so unit 3 returns early
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `d` = 0 |
| 2 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 4 overwrote `b` when it last ran, and is blocked now | `b` = 125 |
| 3 | reads `d` (1) | reruns, returns early | `100 /! 0` | - |
| 4 | overwrites `b` (2), reads `q` (3) | is blocked | unit 3 did not finish | - |
| 5 | reads `b` (2) | reruns | reads `b`, which unit 4, blocked, no longer overwrites | `c` = 126 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

var d = 5

----------
expect unit 1 is edited back so unit 3 finishes
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `d` = 5 |
| 2 | - | untouched | unit 4 overwrites `b` and needs nothing it held | `b` = 500 |
| 3 | reads `d` (1) | reruns | reads `d` from unit 1 | `q` = 20 |
| 4 | overwrites `b` (2), reads `q` (3) | reruns | reads `q` from unit 3, which finished | `e` = 21 |
| 5 | reads `b` (2) | reruns | reads `b` after unit 4, which overwrites it again | `c` = 501 |

----------
engine
----------

| unit | this step | note |
|------|-----------|------|
| 2 | reruns | unit 4 reads from unit 3, which may return early, so its overwrite may not happen and counts as an update |
